SelectResourceHelp=Candidate resource that may fulfill this service.<br><b>Example:</b> Room 101.
UsersPerServiceUnitHelp=Capacity consumed by each sold unit.<br><b>Example:</b> 2 for a booking of two seats per unit.
ResourceRoleHelp=Function performed by the resource in the service.<br><b>Example:</b> Operator for the technician carrying out a repair.
SchedulingModeHelp=Rule used to obtain the reservation interval.<br><b>Example:</b> Next available slot for a workshop inspection.
StartInputModeHelp=Defines whether the user must enter the start.<br><b>Example:</b> Date and time for a medical appointment.
EndInputModeHelp=Defines whether the end is entered, omitted or calculated.<br><b>Example:</b> Calculated for a 60-minute service.
TimePrecisionHelp=Precision required when entering the interval.<br><b>Example:</b> Minute for appointments at 10:15.
ResourceQuantityRequiredHelp=Number of simultaneous resources required.<br><b>Example:</b> 2 operators to install a machine.
DurationBaseMinutesHelp=Fixed service time regardless of quantity.<br><b>Example:</b> 30 minutes for diagnostics.
DurationPerUnitMinutesHelp=Additional time for each sold or produced unit.<br><b>Example:</b> 15 minutes per repaired bicycle.
SetupDurationMinutesHelp=Preparation time that blocks the resource before work.<br><b>Example:</b> 10 minutes to prepare a room.
CleanupDurationMinutesHelp=Time after work during which the resource remains blocked.<br><b>Example:</b> 20 minutes to clean a room.
RequirementGroupHelp=Rows sharing a group are ordered alternatives.<br><b>Example:</b> large_room for Room A and Room B.
MandatoryHelp=Prevents allocation from completing when no resource can fulfill it.<br><b>Example:</b> mandatory for an essential machine.
SimultaneousRequirementHelp=Uses the same interval as the other simultaneous resources.<br><b>Example:</b> room and trainer for the entire course.
AllowSplitRequirementHelp=Allows demand to be distributed across several resources.<br><b>Example:</b> 12 seats split between two vehicles.
